197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 367 0 R
/E (With the Support of the Federal Ministry of Education, Nigerian Board of Technical Education  Nigeria and the World Bank, we enrolled 600 applicants and trained the first cohort of 500 successfully on digital skills training for the purpose of employability.  Students of OCSF free school, girls, youth at risk, disable, orphans and vulnerable youth are the target groups on the program. This initiative provides essential tech skills in web development, digital marketing, and e-commerce. Participants gained both knowledge and real-world experience, helping them break barriers and build sustainable futures in the digital economy. This program offers hope and opportunity to those who have been left behind, giving them the tools to thrive in the new emerging digital World)
/Alt ()
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
