>>
endobj
203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 368 0 R
/E (in partnership with our sister organisation Help Vulnerable children, this event brought vital healthcare services to vulnerable children aged 1-13 affected by sickle cell disease. Out of 75 children who sought help, we successfully provided life-saving medications to 29 at no cost, thanks to your support. Guardians received guidance on managing the disease, easing their frustrations, while children were given nutritious snack packs for added care. We also encouraged families to join an SCD support group for ongoing assistance.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
